# ---- game examples: built files and previews embed the downloaded characters -------
# Rebuild them with: python scripts/cli.py build examples/<folder>/<deck>.md --out build
# The formal examples contain no third-party artwork and are committed with their PPTX, PDF and preview.
examples/studybuddy-obsidian/*.pptx
examples/studybuddy-obsidian/*.pdf
examples/studybuddy-obsidian/preview.png
examples/network-lesson-classic/*.pptx
examples/network-lesson-classic/*.pdf
examples/network-lesson-classic/preview.png
examples/ 
